      "extract": "Introduction The aim of the present paper is to obtain octet and decuplet baryon mass relations of improved accuracy. This is achieved by ﬁrst replacing the classical ﬂavor symmetries by their quantum group counterparts (as in [1–3]) and then accounting for the electromagnetic contributions to baryons masses (as in [4–6]). Quantum groups (which are algebras rather than groups) provide a general- ization of familiar",
